Entity:
- lavaHurt(@Nullable BlockPos): GLOBAL_RW (calls hurtServer + sound play)
- applyEffectsFromBlocksForLastMovements: block-effect application on swept AABB
- updateSwimming: self swim state from water proximity
- moveRelative: pure self deltaMovement update from yaw + speed

Mob:
- inactiveTick: goal/target selector tick when aware
- tickHeadTurn: self body rotation control
- checkDespawn: GLOBAL_RW (queries nearby players, may discard self)

5 batches done. Total annotated methods: 52 (up from 45). Target per
arch §14.3 DG2 is ~130 functions; tracking on schedule.

